# Detection

Sysmon Process Creation

## Objective

Review newly created processes.

## Analyst Question

Which processes were created during the investigation period?

## Data Source

Sysmon Event ID 1

## SPL

```spl
index=main EventCode=1
| table _time ParentImage Image CommandLine User host
| sort _time
```

## Expected Output

A timeline of process creation events showing process lineage and execution details.

## Investigation Notes

Parent-child process relationships are essential when investigating suspicious execution chains.
